      "event_end": "2026-10-26T12:30:00.128Z",
      "summary": "Join us for a guided walk of Queen’s Park, celebrating the season of Autumn. We’ll be taking a look at seasonal changes, hedgerows and more. The walk will meet outside the Queen’s Park Cafe - further instructions to be provided on booking. All welcome, including children of any age - but anyone under 18 should be accompanied by a responsible adult. The walk is free (donations welcome) but booking is essential. Book here",
