      "event_end": "2026-10-26T15:30:00.128Z",
      "summary": "Join us for an afternoon of autumn-themed family fun in Queens Park. Make a leaf crown, join a scavenger hunt, and learn about the seasonal changes in the trees and hedgerows around you. We’ll be located near the cafe from 2pm onwards. All welcome, including children of any age - but anyone under 18 should be accompanied by a responsible adult. This activity is free, and no booking is required. We strongly reccomed arriving at 2pm to take advantage of all activities on offer.",
