      "link": "https://www.heath-hands.org.uk/whatson/hhectwilightwalk",
      "event_start": "2026-10-30T15:30:00.910Z",
      "event_end": "2026-10-30T17:30:00.910Z",
      "summary": "Join us for the launch event of our new Youth programme: Hampstead Heath Eco Club . Learn about our future plans for the club: events, workshops, walks and more, then join us for a guided walk, exploring the Heath at twilight. Will you be lucky enough to hear an owl? Spot a bat? We’ll have UV torches to discover the hidden world of illuminescence, as well as our trusty bat detectors. This is a youth event , open to children age 10-17 only . Booking is required (click the button below), and we’ll send joining instructions prior to the walk. The walk will meet in the Parliament Hill area - further details provided on booking. Book here",
